[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3734328865","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2990#issuecomment-3734328865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2990","id":3734328865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887elVYh","user":{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T09:48:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T09:48:51Z","body":"Confirmed on 72fcb93ef3ae99a5f9fe769a51ea0d50ef702b97. \n\nNodes n1 and n2 can communicate with each other while connections to n3 are blocked with this policy:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"groups\": {\n    \"group:admin\": [\"alice@\"]\n  },\n  \"tagOwners\": {\n    \"tag:foo\": [\n      \"group:admin\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"acls\": [\n    {\n      \"action\": \"accept\",\n      \"src\": [\"group:admin\"],\n      \"dst\": [\"*:*\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"action\": \"accept\",\n      \"src\": [\"autogroup:member\"],\n      \"dst\": [\"autogroup:self:*\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n```\n$ headscale nodes list -t\nID | Hostname | Name | MachineKey | NodeKey | User           | IP addresses                  | Ephemeral | Last seen           | Expiration | Connected | Expired | ForcedTags | InvalidTags | ValidTags\n1  | n1       | n1   | [utXwe]    | [3cter] | alice          | 100.64.0.1, fd7a:115c:a1e0::1 | false     | 2026-01-11 09:43:09 | N/A        | online    | no      |            |             |          \n2  | n2       | n2   | [2zuIW]    | [ujjXu] | alice          | 100.64.0.2, fd7a:115c:a1e0::2 | false     | 2026-01-11 09:43:08 | N/A        | online    | no      |            |             |          \n3  | n3       | n3   | [1eWoG]    | [pk8CP] | tagged-devices | 100.64.0.3, fd7a:115c:a1e0::3 | false     | 2026-01-11 09:43:07 | N/A        | online    | no      | tag:foo    |             |  \n```\n\nConnections to n3 start to work once the `autogroup:self` stanza is removed. ","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3734328865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/3737567048","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2990#issuecomment-3737567048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2990","id":3737567048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz887exr9I","user":{"login":"vdovhanych","id":45185420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTg1NDIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45185420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych","html_url":"https://github.com/vdovhanych","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vdovhanych/subscriptions","organi